+a fixed finite collar of the failed core with no bulk/source remainder:
+such a representation would have zero derivative at p. A matched boundary
+expansion may retain that remainder separately, exactly as it must retain
+the inherited-versus-bare comparison. This finite support test gives no
+uniform lower bound, spatial-decay obstruction or source-radius theorem.
